_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Test Setup:\r\n\r\n```\r\nCREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS kv (k int PRIMARY KEY, v int, c text) WITH TRANSACTIONS = { 'enabled' : true };\r\n\r\nCREATE INDEX by_v ON kv(v);\r\n\r\nINSERT INTO kv(k, v, c) VALUES (1, 11, 'a');\r\nINSERT INTO kv(k, v, c) VALUES (2, 22, 'b');\r\n```\r\n\r\nQuerying for columns covered by the index (such as k which is automatically in the index) on a non-existent row works fine and returns 0 rows as expected.\r\n```\r\ncqlsh:demo> SELECT k FROM kv WHERE v=33;\r\n\r\n k\r\n---\r\n\r\n(0 rows)\r\n```\r\n\r\nBut querying for a column which is not covered by the index for a non-existent row results in the following crash, instead of an empty result set.\r\n```\r\ncqlsh:demo> SELECT c FROM kv WHERE v=33;\r\nOperationTimedOut: errors={'127.0.0.1': 'Client request timeout. See Session.execute[_async](timeout)'}, last_host=127.0.0.1\r\n```","closed_by":{"login":"robertpang","id":30942926,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwOTQyOTI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30942926?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertpang","html_url":"https://github.com/robertpang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertpang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertpang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertpang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertpang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertpang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertpang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertpang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertpang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/robertpang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_adm